      {
        "data": {
          "band": true,
          "body_html": "<p>A restored building can find new purpose. Conservation skills can remain with the people who learn them. Knowledge of a place can become a livelihood. Craft can develop new forms and economic value. A performance can leave behind a conversation.</p><p>What begins through one initiative can create possibilities beyond it.</p>",
          "eyebrow": "What Takes Shape",
          "heading": "The Value Can Extend Beyond the Initiative.",
          "style": "stacked"
        },
        "hidden": false,
        "id": "a3457c6519cf4366ac6004a09bde1feb",
        "styles": {},
        "type": "text"
